0.10.1 23oct2026
* ignore unknown options in [[OpenWeatherMap]] with a warning instead of
  stopping WeeWX at startup
* honor enable = false in [[OpenWeatherMap]], as the WeeWX uploaders do
* mask the appid in the URL that WeeWX logs with debug = 2 or higher. The
  0.6 entry promised this, but the masking was never applied.
* do not start the uploader while appid or station_id is still a
  placeholder (INSERT_APPID_HERE, INSERT_STATION_ID_HERE or replace_me).
  It is logged as a missing option. The uploader used to start and send
  requests with the placeholder.

